{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13222250","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13222250","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1322225001:1":{"text":"펜던트, 이름표... 이걸로 그들의 존재를 충분히 증명할 수 있을 거예요.","source_cn":"吊坠、名牌……好在还有这么多东西可以证明他们的存在。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7EF74F14A7309F31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1322225002:1":{"text":"이름이 보이지 않더라도 그들의 가족이라면 알아볼 수 있을지도 몰라요.","source_cn":"虽然已经看不清名字了，但说不定还有能认出它们的家人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F8A66CF02E5359E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322225003:1":{"text":"심지어 무공을 증명하는 훈장을 가지고 있는 이들도 있어요!","source_cn":"甚至还有人随身带着勋章，证明着他们曾经的赫赫战功！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B662C1931F2ADB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322225004:1":{"text":"전사한 후에도 가슴에 붙어 있던 걸 보면 분명히 매우 소중히 여겼을 거예요.","source_cn":"这枚勋章在战死后都还贴在他的心口，一定是极为看重的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF12D8120FB69C44C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322225005:1":{"text":"어서 이 증거를 캐롤라이나에게 가져다 줘요!","source_cn":"我们快把这些证据带回给卡列琳娜吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02D8123355FF095E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}